@@ -65,6 +65,10 @@ New functions/methods
 Enhancements
 ~~~~~~~~~~~~
 
+- :py:func:`concat` now supports concatenating :py:class:`Dataset` objects with
+  data variables missing from some inputs. The result includes the union of data
+  variables and fills absent values with ``fill_value``.
+
 - :py:class:`~xarray.core.GroupBy` enhancements. By `Deepak Cherian <https://github.com/dcherian>`_.
 
   - Added a repr. Example::
